  m_Name: DoubleDominoInfo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WorkshopExampleInfo
  m_Scene: {fileID: 102900000, guid: 5a88592eefd21544bb7370be497859d9, type: 3}
  m_ScenePath: Assets/Examples/DoubleDomino/DoubleDomino.unity
  m_ExampleName: Double Domino
  m_Category: Shapes
  m_Purpose: "Demonstrates the accuracy of the simulation with the classic double domino effect. Pushing the end domino of a row sends a wave of falling dominoes along it, each one coming to rest leaning on the next. When that wave reaches the end, a second wave runs back the other way as each leaning domino slides down to lie flat.\nThere are five shelves, and the direction alternates from one shelf to the next."
  m_Description: Demonstrating accuracy by simulating the classic double-domino wave.
